{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:investigateRhythmStripFootnote", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "investigateRhythmStripFootnote", "text": "Ran on {ran} {ran, plural, one{day} other{days}}, raised its flag on {raised}. An outlined square is a day it did not run. A clear strip is not a negative result: this is a screen on pulse timing, and it cannot tell an ectopic beat from a dropped beat from the band moving on your wrist.", "sha256": "bc4a47ef0e6bc556b067456d9db95fa22524bf1765c4c0808e026b89820eafe2", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:investigateNoRestingBreathingRate", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "investigateNoRestingBreathingRate", "text": "No resting breathing rate away from sleep", "sha256": "5d0c04d7724ea70d7a5bb38634ae8114dd173b6a82329915c566f8f131b7b12c", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:investigateNoRestingBreathingRateBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "investigateNoRestingBreathingRateBody", "text": "This reads breathing only from three-minute stretches where the band saw you almost completely still, outside the sleep window. Most days have none — a day with none is a day you were moving, not a day anything went wrong.", "sha256": "c18d449eac2a19b748bb9a7d27b7de8bef34022fff78da4b980b4ecb97ef9ee7", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:investigateBreathingAtRestAwake", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "investigateBreathingAtRestAwake", "text": "Breathing at rest, awake", "sha256": "ed5d23d4d8a615e5b850e08cba47fc17abfc744bdb3d6d46d13ce67589b278c4", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:investigateStillStretchesOutsideSleep", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "investigateStillStretchesOutsideSleep", "text": "Still stretches outside sleep", "sha256": "2f5326d73d06d42ec02caf0d212e3b0ce699fd3f43c8e81efa23973003bb4051", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:investigateLowest", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "investigateLowest", "text": "Lowest", "sha256": "5c590931c7cc2ade8aa2012cba335dd5d533c6ccbc9fe08030e97ad6dc1dd578", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:investigateNextLowest", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "investigateNextLowest", "text": "Next lowest", "sha256": "391598cafe59ff2138e6123cf86765a77b6d3a679893e2def6f85879ec92f98f", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:investigateHighestOfThem", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "investigateHighestOfThem", "text": "Highest of them", "sha256": "6361f5a92f30bf3ce7c45543905300321ce55cdfb3c97caef4d7c30a9962fe34", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:investigateFloorNotRateBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "investigateFloorNotRateBody", "text": "A floor, not a rate for the day. Only stretches where you were almost completely still can be read at all, so these are the stillest few minutes the band saw outside your sleep — nothing here describes the rest of your day, and breathing while you move cannot be recovered from beat timing.", "sha256": "292939002cb58a6a7c5143828cc01f33c9092bc402711dd5f967d84a42e2e8b3", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:investigateCycleScreenDidNotRun", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "investigateCycleScreenDidNotRun", "text": "The cycle screen did not run for this night", "sha256": "cce48c8d925a4d7d54bdccae25d3777d5f9c800f441e19c125dd9e7b8a196f92", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:investigateNotEnoughCleanBeats", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "investigateNotEnoughCleanBeats", "text": "Not enough clean beats to run it.", "sha256": "7454e142e28e4da96dd792f8a7cf67b285ae1d5cc6ed29e6bb342d51dc2bab0f", "kind": "arb"}
