{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:investigateAcrossNOwnNights", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "investigateAcrossNOwnNights", "text": "ACROSS {n} OF YOUR OWN NIGHTS", "sha256": "49a7de0ae52a5e78fdd2294c277550f36dd7925e79c96aa215deb39b127740e6", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:investigateCvhrAboveUsual", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "investigateCvhrAboveUsual", "text": "Over your most recent nights, the heart-rate cycling this screen counts has been running higher than across the {n} nights behind it.", "sha256": "6d747d1b3984eb252857b25cb38a6f14d1219b6aba8007c9d128d58f7f6d8af2", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:investigateCvhrInsideUsual", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "investigateCvhrInsideUsual", "text": "Over your most recent nights, the heart-rate cycling this screen counts has stayed inside the range of the {n} nights behind it.", "sha256": "51a229178da65e1608f816843df4239ffe28dafed50022ddf166800ced2f2efd", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:investigateCvhrExplainer", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "investigateCvhrExplainer", "text": "It is a pattern in your pulse, not a measurement of your breathing, and it is not a test for anything. The same cycling comes from an irregular rhythm, from being at altitude, and from any broken-up night — and beta-blockers, diabetes and nerve conditions flatten it, so genuinely disturbed breathing often leaves nothing here at all.", "sha256": "f728c3069690e2d948021d78e99542a35ba74d27fbe39a3691d0c21bdb7b5129", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:investigateCvhrNotNegativeResult", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "investigateCvhrNotNegativeResult", "text": "So nothing here is a negative result and nothing here clears anything, and none of it says anything about any one night — a single night's count moves for a dozen reasons on its own.", "sha256": "5d6cc992755e822c37bc6d2d2bd793168c5d3c5b5fdbd63e275c7de803e92a6b", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:investigateCvhrSeeClinicianIfSymptoms", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "investigateCvhrSeeClinicianIfSymptoms", "text": "If you snore, wake unrefreshed, or someone has seen you stop breathing in your sleep, a clinician can test that properly.", "sha256": "643d2b8d227c3b7e49d52403f53fd3440643bf0c30807ef282254c50804e8500", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:investigateStageMinutesAsCounted", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "investigateStageMinutesAsCounted", "text": "Stage minutes, as counted", "sha256": "d67b7fbfc3ba2744f749e1d499c1824674ff3943b565a292cac6f3c9c843e95a", "kind": "arb"}
