{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:calmBreathingRankingExplainer", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "calmBreathingRankingExplainer", "text": "A ranking of three paces from one sitting. The blocks run back to back, so each pace is measured while you are still settling out of the one before. It says which pace your heart rate followed most strongly, and nothing else.", "sha256": "d034d62678a943cda7349249195958d11dceabf77fed0b7ca920d62782520426", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:calmBreathingVerdictAborted", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "calmBreathingVerdictAborted", "text": "You stopped part way, so there was nothing to compare. Nothing has changed.", "sha256": "a4cd6cbca10f35cf97c5c9b8bbb65bf7c0c0219cdc8b2024bf34890269e813fd", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:calmBreathingVerdictCouldNotScore", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "calmBreathingVerdictCouldNotScore", "text": "At least one pace could not be scored, so there is nothing to rank. Nothing has changed.", "sha256": "4f3b2704d94d8dbee1e2a2059eff5f9a06fd8b0c9855864ee8ec5a280fc4f645", "kind": "arb"}
